      {
        "id": 44501,
        "name": "pcgamerpirate",
        "username": "pcgamerpirate",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pcgamerpirate/{size}/2220_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-11-19T20:04:54.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>La Capitan's Nemisis, maybe a crew member that fell into the portal but was not fortunate enough to be picked up by La Capitan. Instead of mastering the time vortex, the vortex enslaved him. Trapped in the vortex for an eternity, the sight of every possibilty there can, is, was, and ever will be drove him mad, mad enough to loop back around to lucidity, his mind sharpened only by the thought of destroying La Capitan.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>And he knows he will destroy her.</p>",
        "post_number": 30,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:18:04.198Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
